{"skill":{"slug":"google-contacts","displayName":"google-contacts"},"version":{"version":"1.2.6","createdAt":1790937616494,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":53846,"sha256":"0647975d8ab1fe31497c44b7fe8eb96dd277cd8772a1de7e1029621d42dae352","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2069,"sha256":"1d36ab7add1421f53e7d7bd9916bf7b44840faca65496c0a62b9712f4f4ce2cf","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790963173372,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"fed74033263714b90ea8be4ba1f74bc203d212af38b63afaa55d03e7c41cbe1e","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/fed74033263714b90ea8be4ba1f74bc203d212af38b63afaa55d03e7c41cbe1e","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790937911327},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":14,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1790963173372},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed Google Contacts integration that includes clearly labeled Maton automation reference material and requires user approval for sensitive actions.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Requested tools and network access fit an API integration skill. The instructions prohibit reading credential stores, unrelated secrets, browser profiles, or dumping tokens, and default to read/list operations before writes.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Installation uses pinned Maton CLI instructions via npm or Homebrew; no executable files are shipped in the artifact. OAuth credentials are handled by the CLI and OS credential store, with raw HTTP/API-key use documented only as a fallback.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The package includes shared trigger catalog files for other Maton event sources. That is broader than Google Contacts alone, but SKILL.md and the reference files explicitly state these are platform references, not Google Contacts capabilities, and should only be used when the user names and connects that source.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill documents persistent OAuth connections, hosted functions, triggers, destinations, and event watches, but it discloses their persistence, requires separate approval, prefers DENY_ALL network policy, and warns against third-party forwarding or local exec except under user-directed conditions.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The core purpose is coherent: manage Google Contacts and contact groups through Maton-managed OAuth. It can create, update, batch-delete, and automate contact workflows, but those high-impact capabilities are disclosed and repeatedly gated on explicit user approval.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Before installing, be aware that this skill can change or delete Google Contacts data and can set up persistent Maton automations if you approve them. Use the narrowest Google account/scopes, confirm every write or automation, and avoid third-party destinations unless you understand exactly what data will be forwarded.","findings":"[SDI-2] expected: The Linear trigger reference is not a Google Contacts API capability, but the artifact labels it as shared Maton platform event-source documentation and says to use it only when the user has connected Linear and asks by name.\n[SDI-2] expected: The Notion trigger reference documents sensitive event payloads, but it is explicitly segregated as shared platform documentation and contains scoping and disclosure warnings rather than hidden or automatic Notion behavior.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790963173372}}}}}